	(text "R1 = R2 * (Vout / FB - 1)          [1] - page 15 \nVout = (FB * (R1 + R2)) / R2\nFB = 500mV\nVmin = (500mV * (1,1MOhm + 100KOhm + 120KOhm)) / 120KOhm + 100KOhm = 3V\nVmax = (500mV * (1,1MOhm + 100KOhm + 120KOhm)) / 120KOhm = 5,5V\n\n\n \n\n"
